OL,3,GNEWSANo closure for terror victims,
OL,4,Asays Burnham, as survivors tell
OL,5,Aceremony about life after attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FThelma Stober, a survivor of the 7/7
OL,8,FLondon bombings, said victims feel the
OL,9,Feffects for "years and decades" as
OL,10,Fopposed to the "seconds or minutes" of
OL,11,Fthe attack itself
OL,13,FThe room also observed a two-minute
OL,14,Fsilence and there were multiple musical
OL,15,Finterludes
